// Villain Def - NewPraetorians_Aurora_Pena 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P5230380" "Aurora Pena was once known as Mother Mayhem in Praetoria. She was the body that Praetoria's Shalice Tilman used for many years to spread her thought control amongst the populace. Aurora was freed from her prison and now seeks to make up for the horrors that Mother Mayhem committed with her own body."
// DisplayNames :
"P2264613676" "Aurora Pena"

